SUMMARY:Coffee\, Conchas\, & Venue Tour
DESCRIPTION:Join World Forestry Center for a morning made for event planners that includes coffee\, pastries\, and a tour of our venue spaces. We will start in Cheatham Hall\, featuring pastries\, coffee\, and a time for networking. After a short introduction to events at World Forestry Center\, you will be invited to tour some of our premium venue spaces. This gathering is perfect for event planners\, conference organizers\, administrative assistants\, and anyone looking to plan a corporate or business event in Portland. Register in advance!
URL:https://explorewashingtonpark.org/event/coffee-conchas-venue-tour/
LOCATION:World Forestry Center\, 4033 SW Canyon Rd.\, Portland\, OR\, 97221\, United States
