SUMMARY:Flower Pressing Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Connect with nature in a new way through flower pressing! In this beginner workshop\, artist\, Bri Rossi\, will guide you through her tips and tricks for creating beautiful pressed plants. Each workshop attendee will receive a handmade reusable flower press and we’ll fill it up with plants! We’ll cover how to use a flower press\, what plants press best\, where to find plants and fun ideas for how to use the plants you preserve. If the weather permits we’ll take a short walk around the arboretum to identify plants that press well. This event is coordinated by Hoyt Arboretum and registration is required through their website.
URL:https://explorewashingtonpark.org/event/flower-pressing-workshop-4/
LOCATION:Hoyt Arboretum\, 4000 SW Fairview Blvd\, Portland\, OR\, 97221\, United States
END:VEVENT
